# Architecture Rules

Domains:
Core Platform, AgriProfile, AgriShopping, AgriAcademy, AgriExpert, Localization, Commerce.

AgriProfile is a user workspace/aggregation layer, not a duplicate business domain.
AgriShopping owns products and seller product management.
AgriAcademy owns courses and learning.
Commerce owns cart/checkout/orders.
Localization owns geographic primitives.
Cross-domain access must use public contracts/services.
